Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages in The Battle Cats to check out this awesome one-day only Hatsune Miku collab blitz map!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Appearing August 31st from 12:00am until 11:59pm!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Collab Stage in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
A live music celebration with Hatsune Miku and her virtual singer friends!<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・NEW Stage: Hatsune Miku's Birthday!'''}}<br>
Celebrate the birthday of Hatsune Miku with this limited-edition stage!<br>
Get a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food Reward'''}} when you clear the stage for the first time.<br>
