Regular=<p></p>
Hatsune Miku gets Cat-fied... again!<br>
Hatsune Miku & The Battle Cats join together for the return of a special crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Join in on the fun from August 31st (11am) through September 14th, 2020 (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''● Hatsune Miku Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Virtual singers from an electric dimension have warped into the Cat Empire!<br>
For a limited time, select the Hatsune Miku tab at the top of the Rare Capsule menu for a chance to collect powerful Uber Rare collab characters only available during this event! This second edition of this collab includes all-new units like Uber Rare {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Megurine Luka'''}}, Super Rare {{Color|#00CCFF|'''MEIKO & Cat'''}} and Rare {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Luka Cat'''}}!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Limited edition collab units include...'''}}<br>
[[Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Hatune Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A cute & stylish electric pop diva! Strong vs. & Weakens Red, Floating, Angels (Area Attack)<br>
[[Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Powerful and charming twin vocals. Long-range Area attacks might Knockback/Slow Black & Metal!<br>
[[Sakura (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Saukra Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Dive who dances among the cherry blossoms. Area attacks Freeze Aliens and might break Barriers.<br>
[[Megurine Luka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Megurine Luka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Laid-back bilingual vocalist with a silky smooth voice.<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Floating/Black<br>
[[MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Red<br>
[[Luka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Luka Cat (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Alien Attacks

<small><small>※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance to appear from Rare Capsule draws during this event. Standard non-Collab Rare and Super Rare units may also be received during this event.<br>
※If the Hatsune Miku capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
The virtual singer worldwide tour arrives in the Cat Empire for the final dates! Take on limited special stages featuring Hatsune Miku and friends!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Hatsune Miku"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages during this collab event and select the Hatsune Miku map to take on crossover stages!<br>
Clearing any stage in this map for a small chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00FF|'''limited collab unit'''}} [[Miku Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Cat'''}}]]!<br>
More difficult later stages in the map will give you a better chance at collecting Miku Cat! Or you can use a Treasure Radar on any map for a 100% chance to earn this exclusive unit as a drop reward!<br>
<small><small>※ After collecting Miku Cat, activate her for use by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ If you have collected Miku Cat from a previous event, you cannot receive the unit a second time.</small></small>

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "MIKU EXPO"'''}}<br>
Hatsune Miku joins Kagamine Rin & Len for a spectacular world tour to delight virtual singer fans around the globe!<br>
Battle to the beat of beloved Miku songs like "Senbonzakura", and collect tons of bonus XP rewards!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "MIKU CHERRY"'''}}<br>
Check out collab stages heralding the arrival of spring, featuring Hatsune Miku music including hit track "Teo"!<br>
Get awesome bonus item rewards upon stage clear!<br>
These Expert-difficulty stages are only available during this event at the times below! Don't miss out on these extra rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''6:00am~8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''12:00pm~2:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am~10:59am'''}}<br>
<small><small>※ If collab stages do not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Catclaw Dojo Stage: "MikuMiku Music Fest"'''}}<br>
Celebrate the blooming of the cherry trees with a Hatsune Miku ranking challenge!
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Miku Music Fest'''}} and pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Can you defeat enough enemies within the time limit to rank in the top 1% of players?<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!<br>
<small><small>※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. <br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Hatsune Miku stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
<small><small>※These Special missions can only be completed until September 14th at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base during this collab event, you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play everyday and don't miss out on these free gifts!

